  "id": "multidisciplinary-team",
  "term": "multidisciplinary team",
  "definition": "A multidisciplinary team is a group of professionals from more than one discipline who work together to manage complex cases that need input from different areas of expertise. In hospital settings, this kind of teamwork depends on effective collaboration across departments and is strengthened by supportive culture, leadership, and motivation to participate.",
